感耻辱。“嘶……”秦组长倒吸了口凉气，“看来临安也是藏龙卧虎啊，你是通过大厅试练，货真价实的‘赤铜三段’，能把你一招放倒，恐怕只有‘黑铁’以上高手才可以做到了。”白欣研一听，心里不禁好过了点，如果真如组长所说，黑铁级高手面前，自己落败也情理之中……不过，那男人看起来这么年轻，竟然有黑铁的实力？“你没事就是万幸，目前来看，他可能不是恶徒，但一个年轻的黑铁级高手，对每个国家来说都难能可贵，不管他有无恶意，最好还是掌控在国家手中。你把车牌号记下，再把那人的样貌找人尽快画出来，等你忙完手头的事，查查能不能找到他，然后再跟我汇报，切记自己不可轻举妄动”，秦组长道。白欣研立刻应诺下来，挂掉电话后，咬牙切齿喃喃道：“流氓，我非要把你揪出来不可……”……与此同时，在一处城北的小道路边。“叮铃铃……叮铃铃……”手机响了起来，林飞睁开沉沉的眼皮，伸手往旁边随便一摸，但发现根本没床头柜。他这时看清，自己是在出租车里。脑海里回想起，昨天晚上到底发生了什么！自己好像找了个地方，打算叫醒女人，但看女人睡得很香，似乎很久没好好睡过一般，就没忍心叫她，直接就在车里过夜了。林飞起身，一扭头看向后座，果然看见了一张眼眶肿肿的面容，她或许哭过了，但此刻泪水已然风干。陌生的女子已经穿好了原本随便盖着的衣物，虽然很憔悴，但已经冷艳不可方物。她双手抱着膝盖，缩在后座椅上，乌黑的云发乱乱地披散着。看到林飞醒过来盯着她看，她下意识地缩了缩身子，咬着红唇，杏眸中满是复杂的情感，似乎正苦苦地思考着什么。羞涩，愤怒，不甘，怨恨，疑惑……女人的眼里，五味杂陈。她真的很漂亮，手如柔荑，肤如凝脂，齿如瓠犀，螓首蛾眉。古人所说的那种，“一顾倾人城，再顾倾人国”的美貌，恐怕也不过如此。身材比例也是惊人，不管是昨晚那记忆犹新的手感，还是现在这么看，都超过了普通东方女性好身材的范畴。林飞知道，女人肯定已经大致想明白了昨晚发生了什么，可从她昨晚会被气晕过去，就能知道她的保守程度。哪怕知道自己没真对她做什么，也无法轻易原谅自己亲她摸她的重要部位。事实上，仔细想想，昨晚的种种让人血脉贲张的画面，自认为没什么错的林飞，也不太好意思说什么。于是气定神闲地拿起手机，先接老柳打来的电话。“林飞，你在哪啊？怎么车子还没开回来啊？”老柳担心地问。林飞平静地道，“老柳，可能要晚点，我在载一个客人，别担心。”“那行，就怕你出事儿，晚点就晚点，我正好陪你嫂子去买菜，今晚吃饭可别忘了！”“知道了，晚上一定准时”。林飞放下手机，想了想以后，抬头打算跟女人解释一下昨晚的情况……可不等他开口，女子忽然寒声说道：“不用解释了，事情已经发生了，解释毫无意义。开车，送我回去。”林飞干张着嘴，愣了一会儿，看这女人淡定无比，可也只好乖乖地穿上衣服，回驾驶室开车。“小姐你家在哪”。“北秀山庄，八十九号”。林飞虽然从来没去过那地方，但也知道，因为那是临安最为高档的富豪区。果然，这女人身份不简单。女人像是什么也没发生过一样，静静坐在后座上，也不说话，望着窗外，美眸里也不知道在思索着什么，闪过粼粼波光。林飞这时才发现，这个女人清醒的情况下，有着股子脱俗的冰冷气质，好似空谷幽兰，山间寒潭。一会儿功夫后，车子停在了北秀山庄八十九号，一幢算地下车库有四层的豪宅，占地超过四百平米，配备游泳池和花园，简直是造在城市边的皇宫。和其他周围的那些豪宅比，这座看起来也是最为奢华的，足见这女人的家产不菲。事实上，若非女人跟保安是认得的，这辆小捷达压根就不准进入这一富豪区。女人打开车门，下车前，看了一眼出租车里的执照，皱皱黛眉，“这个车主叫柳宏斌，你不是车主？”林飞点点头，“我是代班的，我叫林飞。”女人似乎没兴趣再多问什么，转身就要下车，可刚跨出去一步，就有些头晕目眩，似乎身体还是略显虚弱，站在那扶着太阳穴。“怎么样，我来扶扶你吧”，林飞走下去伸出手。“别碰我！”女人退开了一步，不让他靠近。“别逞强了，你昨晚心脏都停止过，大脑又缺氧，就算休息一夜也不会这么快恢复的”，林飞皱眉道。可女人就是不肯，娇声斥道：“你要是再敢碰我，我立刻报警！你昨晚上对我所做的事，已经触犯了刑法，我若告你上法院，足够让你坐牢三年以上！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0005 The black sky is dark and the sky is bright, on the construction site. Bai Xinyan woke up from a trance, and she noticed something vibrating in her pants pocket. After remembering what happened before she fell into coma, she suddenly sat up from the ground and looked around, but no one was in sight. However, the two strong men were still lying on the ground motionless. Bai Xinyan didn't care whether she was embarrassed or not. She hurriedly reached out and touched the most critical position between her legs. After confirming that nothing in her pants had been touched and that she had not been violated, she breathed a sigh of relief. But then there was a burst of anger. The bastard took away another woman, but left him casually on the construction site! ? Taking out his mobile phone, Bai Xinyan tried his best to pick up his energy and picked up the phone seriously as soon as he saw the person. \"Xinyan, why didn't you report the results of last night's investigation to me?\" A vigorous man's voice came from the other side. \"I'm sorry, Team Leader Qin. I found two robbers on my way back. I wanted to arrest them, but I met a mysterious master driving a taxi. I was knocked unconscious by him...\" \"Robbers? Mysterious master? What happened...\" Bai Xinyan briefly reported what happened last night. After listening to this, Team Leader Qin said solemnly: \"Are you sure you can't even dodge one of his moves?\" \"He's too fast, and the angle of his attack is too tricky to dodge.\" Bai Xinyan gritted his silver teeth, feeling deeply ashamed. \"Hiss...\" Team leader Qin took a breath, \"It seems that there are hidden dragons and crouching tigers in La'an. You have passed the hall trial and are a genuine 'Red Copper Level 3'. I'm afraid only a master above 'Black Iron' can knock you down with one move.\" \"I did it.\" When Bai Xinyan heard this, he couldn't help but feel a little better. If it was true as the team leader said, it would be reasonable for him to lose in front of a black iron level master... However, that man looks so young, he actually has the strength of black iron? \"You're lucky that you're fine. At present, he may not be a villain, but a young black iron-level master is valuable to every country. Regardless of whether he has malicious intentions or not, it is best to keep it in the hands of the country. Write down the license plate number, and find someone to draw the person's face as soon as possible. When you finish what you are doing, check to see if you can find him, and then report to me. Remember not to act rashly,\" said Team Leader Qin. Bai Xinyan immediately agreed. After hanging up the phone, he gritted his teeth and murmured: \"Rogue, I have to catch you out...\"... At the same time, on the side of a small road in the north of the city. \"Ding ding ding... ding ding ding...\" The phone rang. Lin Fei opened his heavy eyelids and reached to the side to touch casually, but found that there was no bedside table at all. He saw clearly now that he was in a taxi. I recall in my mind, what happened last night! I seemed to have found a place and planned to wake the woman up, but seeing that the woman was sleeping soundly, as if she hadn't slept well for a long time, I didn't have the heart to wake her up and just spent the night in the car. Lin Fei stood up, turned around and looked at the back seat, and sure enough he saw a face with swollen eyes. She might have cried, but her tears had dried by now. The strange woman had already put on the clothes that she had casually covered herself with. Although she was very haggard, she was already stunning. She hugged her knees with her hands and huddled in the back seat, her black hair disheveled. Seeing Lin Fei wake up and stare at her, she shrank subconsciously, biting her red lips, her almond-shaped eyes full of complex emotions, as if she was thinking hard about something. Shyness, anger, unwillingness, resentment, doubt... There are all kinds of mixed feelings in the woman's eyes. She is really beautiful, her hands are like catkins, her skin is like gelatin, her teeth are like gourd rhinoceros, and her head is like a furry eyebrow. The kind of beauty that the ancients said, \"Look at the charming city and then look at the charming country\" is probably nothing more than this. The body proportions are also amazing. Whether it is the feeling that I still remember last night or looking at it now, it is beyond the scope of ordinary Oriental women's good figures. Lin Fei knew that the woman must have roughly understood what happened last night, but from the fact that she fainted from anger last night, you can know how conservative she is. Even if he knew that he didn't really do anything to her, he couldn't easily forgive himself for kissing her and touching her important parts. In fact, if you think about it carefully, Lin Fei, who thought there was nothing wrong with all the blood-curdling scenes last night, was too embarrassed to say anything. So he picked up the phone calmly and answered the call from Lao Liu first. \"Lin Fei, where are you? Why hasn't the car come back yet?\" Lao Liu asked worriedly. Lin Fei said calmly, \"Old Liu, it might be late. I'm picking up a guest, so don't worry.\" \"That's okay, I'm afraid something might happen to you, so I'll be late. I happen to accompany your sister-in-law to buy groceries, so don't forget to eat tonight!\" \"I know, I'll be on time tonight.\" Lin Fei put down his cell phone, thought about it, and raised his head to explain the situation last night to the woman... But before he could speak, the woman suddenly said in a cold voice: \"No need to explain, it has happened, and explanations are meaningless. Drive and take me back.\" Lin Fei opened his mouth and was stunned for a while. Seeing that the woman was very calm, he had to put on his clothes obediently and return to the cab to drive. \"Miss, where is your home?\" \"Beixiu Villa, No. 89.\" Although Lin Fei has never been to that place, he knows it because it is the most upscale wealthy area in Lin'an. Sure enough, this woman's identity is not simple. As if nothing had happened, the woman sat quietly in the back seat without speaking, looking out the window, her beautiful eyes flashing with sparkling light as she didn't know what she was thinking about. Only then did Lin Fei realize that when she was awake, this woman had an otherworldly cold temperament, like an orchid in an empty valley or a cold pool in the mountains. After a while, the car stopped at No. 89 Beixiu Villa, a four-story mansion including an underground garage. It covers an area of ​​more than 400 square meters and is equipped with a swimming pool and garden. It is like a palace built on the edge of the city. Compared with other surrounding mansions, this one looks", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}